fields.value:
{{Debuffnotes
| name = Spear of Mars
| desc = The {{M|True Sight}} component affects [[debuff immune]] enemy units.<br><br>The {{M|forced movement}} applied no longer affects the debuff immune enemy units.<br><br>If the spear connects with an obstacle, the {{M|debuff}} is applied as if the unit was pushed along.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** The spear [[projectile]] is created on Mars' current location and travels in a straight line accordingly to Mars' {{M|facing angle}}.
** Does not affect enemy heroes behind Mars upon cast.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** Has a {{#var:Spear of Mars basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}}, with a {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{calc|v1/{{#var:Spear of Mars basic1}} round2|v1={{#var:Spear of Mars value1}}}}-second max travel distance time when no heroes are impaled.
*** A spear may only impale {{#var:Spear of Mars value3}} ({{Symbol|bonus shd}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Spear of Mars value3 shd}}|shd}}) valid enemy heroes '''at any given time'''.
** [[File:Dota2 Mars Impale icon.png|21px|The Impale ability component]] {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Applies the following ability effects onto the heroes dragged:
**** The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**** {{Symbol|Vision|Flying}}
***** Grants a 1-second {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} 300-radius [[flying vision]] as the spear travels.
***** When an enemy hero is impaled, {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Vision]]LingerDuration {{=}} [[Stun]]Duration}}
***** Grants {{M|True Sight}} over the affected heroes.
**** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|mars_spear_impale}}
***** The {{M|knockback}} component.
***** {{M|Stuns}} the affected heroes for the remaining travel distance.
***** Offensively {{M|Turn Rate|text=turns}} affected heroes' {{M|facing angle}} toward the direction the spear originated from.

* [[File:Dota2 Mars Impale icon.png|21px|The Impale ability component]] {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
** Applies the {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|mars_spear_impale_stun}} debuff when the affected heroes are impaled onto the following objects:
*** {{A|Mars|Arena of Blood}}
*** Both {{M|trees}} and {{M|planted trees}}.
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Impassable terrain}} from lower elevation.
*** Map edges walls.
*** {{M|Pathing blocker}} sources.
** Does not impale heroes onto the following terrains:
*** Item {{M|shops}}.
*** The border walls of both {{M|faction|x}}'s bases.
*** {{A|Earthshaker|Fissure}} segments.
*** Stair arches.
*** {{U|Watcher|text=Watchers}}
** The {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|impale_stun}} additionally has the following properties:
*** {{Symbol|Trees}}
**** Trees within 100-radius around the impaled heroes are destroyed after the debuff expires.
*** The following {{M|knockback}} components have no effect when the debuff is active:
**** {{A|Mars|God's Rebuke}}
**** {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Mars|Bulwark}}
**** {{A|Mars|Arena of Blood}}

* All ability components considers {{M|clones}} and {{M|illusions}} as heroes, {{M|creep-heroes}} and '''non-impaled heroes''' as creeps.
** The spear does not interact with the following units:
*** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
** For creeps:
*** Deals the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*** Applies a non-disabling {{M|knockback}} correspondingly to the angle between the affected units and the spear {{M|projectile}}.
*** {{Symbol|Trees}}
**** Trees within 100-radius around that the affected units come in contact with are destroyed.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} The spear now creates multiple {{ValueColor||{{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value4 shd}}|shd}}-second {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value1 shd}}|shd}}-radius fire cells as it travels forward.
** [[File:Dota2 Mars Spear of Mars Trajectory-1.png|84px|Spear of Mars' Fire Cells]][[File:Dota2 Mars Spear of Mars Trajectory-2.png|84px|Spear of Mars' Fire Cells]][[File:Dota2 Mars Spear of Mars Trajectory-3.png|84px|Spear of Mars' Fire Cells]][[File:Dota2 Mars Spear of Mars Trajectory-4.png|84px|Spear of Mars' Fire Cells]]
*** {{hi|Mars}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]] [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] ... [[File:Dota2 PtoP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|21px|P]]
**** {{Code|PP' {{=}} 140}}
**** {{Code|OP {{=}} {{#expr:140/3 round2}}}}
** Each created cell has its own independent duration, and provides a negative {{M|aura}} that applies the {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|special_mars_spear_burning_trail_burn}} on affected enemy units within its radius. Hence, the first created cell disappears earlier than the fire cell created at the end location.
** Deals {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value2 shd}}*{{#var:Spear of Mars basic3}}}}|shd}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in {{ValueColor||{{#var:Spear of Mars basic3}}|shd}}-second intervals.
*** This immediately affects enemies upon applying the damage per second {{M|debuff}}.
** Other {{M|Aghanim's Shard|text=ability upgrade}} effects are applied in {{ValueColor||{{#var:Spear of Mars basic2}}|shd}}-second intervals instead.
** {{Symbol|Target|Area-inter}}
*** Multiple overlapping fire cell radius do not stack.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Spear of Mars icon0}}
| desc = Mars throws his legendary Spear with deadly precision, damaging each enemy unit it strikes. The first enemy hero it hits is skewered on the spear, pushing it back. If a skewered hero hits a tree, building, or cliff, they will be impaled to it and stunned.
}}
* The ability checks for the {{M|bound radius}} of valid objects upon {{M|projectile}} impact.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** Plays a 1.7-second ability animation upon a successful Spear of Mars impale cast.

* The ability checks if {{A|Mars|Bulwark}} is toggled {{Symbol|Toggle|On}} upon cast, and automatically toggles Bulwark {{Symbol|Toggle|Off}} before its {{M|cast point}}.
** If Spear of Mars is not successfully cast, Bulwark automatically toggles {{Symbol|Toggle|On}} again.
** This indirectly causes Mars to {{M|Turn Rate|text=turn}} toward the point-targeted location despite Bulwark being toggled {{Symbol|Toggle|On}}.
<hr>
* {{cf|shdnotes}} Deals up to {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value2 shd}}*({{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value4 shd}}+{{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value5 shd}})}}|shd}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) within the radius, over {{ValueColor||{{#expr:({{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value4 shd}}+{{#var:Spear of Mars type3 value5 shd}})/{{#var:Spear of Mars basic2}}}}|shd}} damage instances with the {{M|aura}} linger duration.

