 * {{hi|Mars}} {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} [[File:Dota2 Mars God's Rebuke Visualized.png|84px|God's Rebuke Visualized]]
** Immediately applies all ability effects within a {{#var:God's Rebuke value2}} {{#var:God's Rebuke value1}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:God's Rebuke value1 tal}}|10tal}})-radius [[Wikipedia:Circular sector|circular sector]] area-of-effect, correspondingly to Mars' current {{M|facing angle}}, regardless of the ability's {{M|cast range}}.
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*#* Procs any {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal, except {{M|cleave}}.
*#* {{Symbol|Critical Strike}}
*#** God's Rebuke is an ensured [[critical strike]] source.
*#** Sources with lesser critical values have no effect if they proc as the higher factor takes precedence.
*#* Has {{M|True Strike}}.
*#* Not affected by {{M|disarm}} sources.
*#* The following ability components are not applied on affected enemy units that {{M|die}} from the [[instant attack]] damage instance.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[knockback]]}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Knockback|Front}}
*#* This non-disabling component is not applied on enemy units impaled by {{A|Mars|Spear of Mars}}.
*#* {{Symbol|Trees}}
*#** [[Trees]] within 100-radius that the affected unit come in contact with are destroyed.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|mars_gods_rebuke_slow}}
*# {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Conditional}}
*#* God's Rebuke is a bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}} source and has the following properties:
*#** The enemy hero bonus attack damage values are directly added to Mars' attack damage in the {{M|combat log}} and not displayed on the [[HUD]].
*#** Considers enemy {{M|clones}}, {{M|illusions}}, and the {{H|Spirit Bear}} as heroes; other {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
*#* Does not interact with the following sources:
*#** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
*#** Percentage-based {{M|bonus attack damage|x}} sources.
*#* Interacts with the following sources:
*#** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#*** {{M|Lifesteal}} sources.
*#** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#*** {{M|Damage block}} sources.

